      },
      "text": "CLASS: Aves\n  ORDER: e.g., Passeriformes\n    SUBORDER: e.g., Oscines (Passeri)\n      FAMILY: e.g., Fringillidae (finches)\n        GENUS: e.g., Fringilla\n          SPECIES: e.g., Fringilla coelebs (chaffinch)\n            SUBSPECIES: e.g., F. c. coelebs (nominate)"
    },
