        "title": "Systematics and Major Groups",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "SPECIES CONCEPTS:\n  Biological Species Concept (BSC): reproductively isolated\n  Phylogenetic Species Concept (PSC): diagnosable by unique character\n  PSC splits more species (some estimates: 18,000+ vs 10,600)\n  IOC and Clements use intermediate (BSC-weighted)\n  New species described annually by vocalisation analysis\n```"
    },
